      "title": "公司简介",
      "html": "<section class=\"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-white\">\n  <nav class=\"container mx-auto px-6 py-4 flex justify-between items-center\">\n    <div class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-blue-600\">英国招生合作伙伴</div>\n    <div class=\"hidden md:flex space-x-8\">\n      <a href=\"#home\" class=\"text-blue-600 font-medium\">公司简介</a>\n      <a href=\"#services\" class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600\">业务展示</a>\n      <a href=\"#team\" class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600\">团队介绍</a>\n      <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"text-gray-600 hover:text-blue-600\">联系方式</a>\n    </div>\n    <button class=\"md:hidden text-gray-600\">\n      <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" class=\"h-6 w-6\" fill=\"none\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\">\n        <path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\" />\n      </svg>\n    </button>\n  </nav>\n\n  <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6 py-16 md:py-24\">\n    <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center\">\n      <div class=\"md:w-1/2 mb-12 md:mb-0\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-6\">专业英国教育招生服务</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-lg text-gray-600 mb-8\">我们致力于为中国学生提供优质的英国院校申请服务，拥有10年行业经验，成功帮助数千名学生实现留学梦想。</p>\n        <div class=\"flex space-x-4\">\n          <a href=\"#services\" class=\"px-6 py-3 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-700 transition\">了解业务</a>\n          <a href=\"#contact\" class=\"px-6 py-3 border border-blue-600 text-blue-600 rounded-lg hover:bg-blue-50 transition\">联系我们</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"md:w-1/2\">\n        <div class=\"relative group cursor-pointer\" data-image-placeholder=\"true\">\n          <div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-200 to-gray-300 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\" style=\"height:400px\">\n            <div class=\"text-center\"><div class=\"text-4xl mb-2\">📷</div><div class=\"text-sm text-gray-500\">点